---
/**
 * SocialIcon — brand mark for a social/contact channel.
 *
 * Inline SVG, monochrome, `fill="currentColor"` so it inherits the
 * parent's text color (and `hover:text-accent` on the link). Zero runtime,
 * no external icon font, no fetch. Limited to the channels the contact
 * page uses; add a new entry to `paths` as new channels land.
 */
